#. module: auto_archive_rules
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:auto_archive_rules.auto_archive_rule_view_form
msgid ""
"New rules are disabled on purpose. Click <strong>Preview</strong> to\n"
"                        check exactly which records this rule matches, then switch\n"
"                        <strong>Enabled</strong> on to let the daily scheduled action apply it.\n"
"                        Records younger than the built-in minimum age are never archived; users,\n"
"                        companies and technical models cannot be targeted, and the contacts behind\n"
"                        a user or a company are always left alone.\n"
"                        A rule applies to <strong>every company</strong> in the database — add a\n"
"                        company condition to the filter if you want to limit it — and archives at\n"
"                        most a few thousand records per run, continuing on the following days."
msgstr ""

